 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Listen, I tell you a mystery, it is written in the word",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.94,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "We will not all sleep, but the trumpet will be heard",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.8,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "In an instant, in the blink of an eye",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.43,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The dead will be raised imperishable, and we will be changed",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.68,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Where, O death, is your victory",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.24,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Where, O death, is your sting",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.55,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Death has been swallowed up in victory",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.34,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But thanks be to God, who gives us the victory",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.41,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Through our Lord Jesus Christ",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.7,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Every body that is breaking, every friend we laid to rest",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.82,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Will put on the imperishable and rise up from the dust",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.46,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The sting of death is sin, and the power of sin is the law",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 14,
   "error_s": 0.35,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
